      <title>3D堆叠不会烧 华为韬定律用实测数据反驳3D堆叠发热论</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260907/3D%E5%A0%86%E5%8F%A0%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E7%83%A7-%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%BA%E9%9F%AC%E5%AE%9A%E5%BE%8B%E7%94%A8%E5%AE%9E%E6%B5%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%8F%8D%E9%A9%B33D%E5%A0%86%E5%8F%A0%E5%8F%91%E7%83%AD%E8%AE%BA/</link>
